sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    title Scenario 1: Multi-Criteria Search & Direct Contact (BR-05, BR-06)
    actor C as 👤 Consumer
    participant UI as 🖥️ React Frontend
    participant API as ⚙️ WorkersController
    participant Repo as 📦 ServiceProviderRepository
    participant DB as 🗄️ PostgreSQL

    C->>UI: Selects "Electrician", District "Patuakhali", Upazila "Dumki"
    UI->>API: GET /api/workers/search?category=Electrician&districtId=1&upazilaId=1
    API->>Repo: SearchWorkersAsync("Electrician", 1, 1, null, page=1, pageSize=12)
    Repo->>DB: SELECT * FROM service_provider_profiles WHERE verification_status = 'VERIFIED' AND ...
    DB-->>Repo: Returns verified worker records + total count
    Repo-->>API: (WorkersList, TotalCount)
    API-->>UI: 200 OK JSON { totalCount, totalPages, workers[] }
    UI-->>C: Renders Worker Cards with Rating ⭐ 4.8 & Experience
    C->>UI: Clicks "Contact Worker"
    UI-->>C: Reveals Raw Phone Number "📞 01811111111" (tel:01811111111)
    C->>C: Directly dials tradesperson on mobile phone without intermediary fees
